    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Recognizing individuals who have played an integral role in pursuing excellence in their graduate medical education programs, Accreditation Council for Graduate Medical Education International (ACGME-I) recently announced the 2024 ACGME International Award recipients. Dr Rizwan Khan and Dr Novera Chughtai from AKU received the Physician Leader and Physician Educator award.",
